:"https://osmsdataexplorer.com/data/current/images/items/05000010.png"},{"item_id":5000011,"name":"Maple Snail","category":"Pet","count":1,"period_days":0,"life":30,"description":"A rare-shaped snail that came along with MapleStory Fest 2026. The pet's skills will disappear once its magic runs out.\nIf you double-click the Maple Snail after its magic duration ends, it will disappear.\n\nCaution! This pet cannot have its magic duration extended after it ends.","icon_url":"https://osmsdataexplorer.com/data/current/images/items/05000011.png"},{"item_id":5000012,"name":"Monkey","category":"Pet","count":1,"period_days":0,"life":90,"description":"Very charming and very intuitive, but not as obedient as some of the others.","icon_url":"https://osmsdataexplorer.com/data/current/images/items/05000012.png"},{"item_id":5000013,"name":"White Tiger","category":"Pet","count":1,"period_days":0,"life":90,"description":"They are very gentle and obedient in nature, easily becoming friendly with their owner, which in turn speeds up the level-up process.","icon_url":"https://osmsdataexplorer.com/data/current/images/items/05000013.png"},{"item_id":5000014,"name":"Elephant","category":"Pet","count":1,"period_days":0,"life":90,"description":"Very outgoing and mature; doesn't need to be fed all the time. An intelligent pet that easily understands the commands from the master.","icon_url":"https://osmsdataexplorer.com/data/current/images/items/05000014.png"},{"item_id":5000015,"name":"Dasher","category":"Pet","count":1,"period_days":0,"life":90,"description":"They are smart and obedient by nature, picking up commands faster than other pets, but they also can get hungry in a hurry.","icon_url":"https://osmsdataexplorer.com/data/current/images/items/05000015.png"},{"item_id":5000016,"name":"Robot","category":"Pet","count":1,"period_days":0,"life":90,"description":"A hyper-active robot that always changes its mind on everything. Very unpredictable, yet easy to please.\nCaution! This pet cannot